# .NET build output for the WebView2 host.
#
# host/bin/Release/net8.0-windows IS tracked, exactly like lib/: a
# github: install fetches the repository tree, so a gitignored host binary
# would leave the plugin unable to start its browser window. Intermediate
# output and self-contained publishes are not tracked.
host/obj/
host/publish/
host/bin/Debug/
